{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-09-22 10:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN HONORS 48 CUSTOMERS WITH THOROUGHBRED CHEMICAL SAFETY AWARD', 'text': 'AWARD RECOGNIZES THE SAFE HANDLING OF HAZARDOUS MATERIALS ATLANTA , SEPT. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT\xa048 OF ITS CUSTOMERS HAVE EARNED THE 2021 THOROUGHBRED CHEMICAL SAFETY AWARD FOR SAFELY HANDLING PRODUCTS REGULATED AS HAZARDOUS MATERIALS.'}